          "type": "markdown",
          "title": "RBAC",
          "markdownContent": "Service accounts, roles, and bindings are available under **Infrastructure → Kubernetes → Security** (fed by the cluster collector `k8s_objects` stream). OpenObserve-style join SQL is not used in this library dashboard.",
          "queryType": "sql",
          "queries": [
